          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Astrophotographers take long exposure photographs, keeping the camera’sphotographs, keeping the camera’s shutter open for a long time. In suchshutter open for a long time. In such a photograph, the apparent motion ofa photograph, the apparent motion of the stars is recorded as arcs of a circle,the stars is recorded as arcs of a circle, known as star trails."
            }
